      "title": "Schelling\u2019s substantive reinterpretation of the transcendental turn: beyond method",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Sebastian Gardner",
          "openalex_id": "A5054084391",
          "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3066-5903",
